• Customer Care Technology Enablement: Engineer, administer, and optimize Customer Care technologies that enable customer service and revenue-supporting operations. Manage telephony, including voice, callbacks, and outbound dialers, alongside messaging, SMS, social media, email, chatbots, and external platform integrations. Manage routing, IVRs, phone numbers, operational configurations, platform health, releases, and vendor coordination across Genesys Cloud CX, Twilio, Mindful Feedback, and other platforms and services.

