• Automation: Identify and automate repetitive or inefficient processes. Build, test, document, maintain, and improve approved automations.&nbsp;

• AI Adoption: Use approved AI capabilities to improve daily tasks, including investigation, analysis, documentation, knowledge retrieval, ticket handling, and other operational activities.&nbsp;

• AI and Automation Administration: Administer approved AI and automation capabilities, including configuration, access, integrations, monitoring, and governance controls.

• Reporting and Audit: Develop and maintain reports and dashboards, fulfil data requests, and provide audit evidence.

